{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51983","headline":"月夜吟（李西美帅成都，士人陈甲馆於便斋。月夜有危髻古衣裳妇人数辇，笑语花圃中，有甚丽者诵诗云云。忽不见。今府第，故蜀宫，岂当时宫女犹有鬼耶？） 一 · 蜀宫人","name":"月夜吟（李西美帅成都，士人陈甲馆於便斋。月夜有危髻古衣裳妇人数辇，笑语花圃中，有甚丽者诵诗云云。忽不见。今府第，故蜀宫，岂当时宫女犹有鬼耶？） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧时衣服尽云霞，不到迎仙不是家。\n今日楼台浑不识，只余古木记宣华。\n（按《蜀檮杌》。\n宣华，故苑名。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀宫人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}